<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login - OrganizaPay</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-red: #e50914;
      --brand-red-dark: #a80710;
      --brand-gold: #f4b400;
      --brand-ink: #241416;
      --brand-card: rgba(255, 251, 251, 0.94);
      --brand-muted: #6b5b60;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.32), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(244, 180, 0, 0.16), transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #120608 0%, #1c0b0f 42%, #261115 100%);
      color: var(--brand-ink);
    }

    .login-shell {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .login-shell::before,
    .login-shell::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto;
      border-radius: 999px;
      filter: blur(18px);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .login-shell::before {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      top: -20px;
      right: -18px;
      background: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.22);
    }

    .login-shell::after {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      left: -12px;
      bottom: -22px;
      background: rgba(244, 180, 0, 0.14);
    }

    .login-container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: var(--brand-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      border-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      width: min(100%, 300px);
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 16px 22px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.22));
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      padding: 0.42rem 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.08);
      color: var(--brand-red-dark);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4vw, 1.95rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--brand-ink);
    }

    .lead-text {
      color: var(--brand-muted);
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      max-width: 30ch;
    }

    .btn-google {
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #403336;
      border: 1px solid rgba(36, 20, 22, 0.12);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 18px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(20, 8, 10, 0.08);
    }

    .btn-google:hover {
      background-color: #fff7f7;
      border-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.25);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.12);
    }

    .btn-google:focus-visible {
      outline: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);
    }

    .google-icon {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .restricted-note {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      color: var(--brand-muted);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .policy-copy {
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--brand-muted);
    }

    .policy-copy a {
      color: var(--brand-red-dark);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .policy-copy a:hover {
      color: var(--brand-red);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .alert {
      border-radius: 16px;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 576px) {
      body {
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .login-container {
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 24px;
      }

      .brand-logo {
        width: min(100%, 260px);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-shell">
    <div class="login-container">
      <div class="logo-wrapper">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="OrganizaPay" class="brand-logo">
      </div>

      <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
          <%= error %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="eyebrow">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i>
        Acesso seguro
      </div>
      <h2>Entre com sua conta Google</h2>
      <p class="lead-text">Controle financeiro familiar, acompanhamento da fatura e visão clara dos gastos em tempo real.</p>

      <a href="/auth/google" class="btn btn-google w-100 mb-2">
        <svg class="google-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/>
          <path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/>
          <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/>
          <path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/>
          <path fill="none" d="M0 0h48v48H0z"/>
        </svg>
        Entrar com Google
      </a>

      <div class="restricted-note">
        Acesso restrito a usuários autorizados.
      </div>

      <div class="policy-copy">
        Ao continuar, você concorda com o processamento dos dados necessários para autenticação e uso do aplicativo.
        <a href="/privacy-policy">Política de Privacidade</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
